    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Trace\r\n\r\n**Do This:** \r\n1. Trace this program by hand.\r\n2. For each pass through the loop, write down the value of count and whether the condition is True or False.\r\n3. What is the final value of count when the loop ends?\r\n4. Add a print statement inside the loop that shows whether the condition (count < 5) is True or False on each pass. Run the program and compare the output to what you traced by hand — did it match?\r\n\r\n**Stuck? Try asking the AI Tutor how to print whether a condition is True or False inside your loop**",
